# Q13 What is a concept vs a named measure vs a report? A report or tracker and a measure are both measure definitions, told apart by their kind.
PREFIX kpi: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/kpi/>
PREFIX kind: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/kpi/measure-kind/>
PREFIX measure: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/kpi/measure/>
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
SELECT ?report ?metric WHERE {
  ?report a kpi:MeasureDefinition ; kpi:measureKind kind:tracker-or-report .
  ?metric a kpi:MeasureDefinition ; kpi:measureKind kind:operational-metric .
} LIMIT 1
